<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Ordinata — third-party notices</title>
<style>
body{font:15px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 1.5rem;max-width:60rem;color:#1a1a1a;background:#fff}
h1{font-size:1.6rem}
h2{font-size:1.05rem;margin:2rem 0 .4rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}
pre{background:#f7f7f7;border:1px solid #e3e3e3;border-radius:4px;padding:.8rem;overflow-x:auto;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap}
.used-by{color:#555;font-size:13px;margin:.2rem 0 .6rem}
.intro{background:#f2f2f7;border:1px solid #b9b9c4;border-radius:5px;padding:.8rem 1rem}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Ordinata — third-party notices</h1>

<p class="intro">Ordinata is built on the open-source libraries listed below. Each is
used under the licence reproduced with it, and each licence's attribution requirement is
discharged by this file. Ordinata itself is licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
in the LICENSE file that ships with it.</p>

{{#each licenses}}
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
<p class="used-by">Used by:
{{#each used_by}}<a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}
</p>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}

<hr>
<p><small>Ordinata &middot; Draconitic Labs &middot; support@draconitic.com</small></p>
</body>
</html>
